WEBVTT

00:37:58.500 --> 00:38:00.351
And therefore, I can say yes to you

00:38:00.375 --> 00:38:03.184
and to you and to you
and everybody I've said yes to.

00:38:03.208 --> 00:38:05.143
And then everybody at the end resents me

00:38:05.167 --> 00:38:09.268
because I have not been able
to fulfill the yeses to all the people.

00:38:09.292 --> 00:38:12.976
And in the end, I know what everybody else
thinks, feels and wants,

00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:15.434
and I have no clue
what goes on inside of me

00:38:15.458 --> 00:38:20.643
because I'm organized
by this threat and dread.

00:38:20.667 --> 00:38:22.684
AG: It seems like you known me very well.

00:38:22.708 --> 00:38:23.726
(Laughter)

00:38:23.750 --> 00:38:25.309
Yeah, I mean when I think about,

00:38:25.333 --> 00:38:27.684
when I would describe myself
as a people pleaser,

00:38:27.708 --> 00:38:28.976
I think of a few things.

00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:31.726
One is prioritizing
other people's feelings